SY_TALK("zmE1IEwM2C4",[[0,["Sahaja Yogi: And Her family members and Herself"]],[3,["were the victims of considerable oppression and even jailed,"]],[8,["at the time when … prior to British withdrawal."]],[13,["Two thousand years ago?"]],[15,["Shri Mataji: So that was the calendar they started."]],[17,["Sahaja Yogi: That was when it started."]],[18,["Shri Mataji: It's very ancient, even at the time of Shri Krishna."]],[20,["Sahaja Yogi: It's a most ancient lineage."]],[25,["She's doing this spiritual work since 1970."]],[33,["The work She's doing is granting en-masse Self-realization"]],[38,["to seekers of truth."]],[41,["There is no organization, there is no money paid."]],[46,["We call ourselves Sahaja Yogis."]],[49,["We're professional people, we're business people,"]],[51,["we're ordinary members of the public"]],[53,["who just conduct their lives in a perfectly normal way."]],[58,["And She is, I think, well known"]],[61,["for being an outspoken critic of many of the false gurus"]],[65,["that are purveying their ways in the marketplace today."]],[69,["So, She'll tell you anything you wish to know"]],[72,["about Her message and the work that She's doing."]],[77,["Basically, it's to put you in touch with your spirit"]],[80,["so that you become a master of your own Self."]],[86,["You don't depend upon a guru,"]],[87,["you don't depend slavishly upon any other external influence,"]],[94,["but you become master of your Self."]],[97,["So without any further introduction"]],[99,["I'd like you to meet Mataji Nirmala Devi."]],[110,["Shri Mataji: Now, I think, we should have questions first."]],[114,["Journalist: What is Self-realization and how do You grant it?"]],[121,["Shri Mataji: Self-realization"]],[126,["is the epitome of our evolutionary process,"]],[133,["which is a living process"]],[135,["through which you achieve your higher Self."]],[141,["Even Darwin, who was an atheist, did say"]],[145,["that as human beings have come so far"]],[150,["they will achieve their absolute."]],[153,["So, to achieve your absolute means to get Self-realization."]],[157,["The purpose of our life, the meaning of our life"]],[162,["is only achieved when we will get connected"]],[166,["with the divine Power, which is all-pervading."]],[171,["Now, one need not believe in the divine Power,"]],[174,["but you can see the manifestation of this living divine Power"]],[180,["when you see a flower becoming a fruit."]],[183,["All living work is done by this divine Power."]],[187,["But we are not aware of it."]],[189,["At this human stage we are not aware of it."]],[192,["But once this happening takes place in your awareness …"]],[197,["it's not just suggesting"]],[199,["that you become something great or on … on mental level,"]],[203,["but actualization of this experience is felt"]],[207,["in your awareness, on your central nervous system."]],[210,["You can feel that you have become — again I say, you have become,"]],[215,["not told or brainwashed, but you have become —"]],[218,["collectively conscious."]],[221,["Is a state where you can feel"]],[224,["your Self inside and others' too."]],[230,["Now, the knowledge of this is the knowledge of the roots."]],[234,["Whatever we have achieved is the knowledge of the tree."]],[238,["But if the tree outgrows itself from its root, then it may die."]],[245,["So it is time that we should find out about the roots."]],[251,["And to know about that, we have to become a subtler being."]],[255,["At this human awareness you cannot."]],[258,["But sometimes it challenges the ego of people."]],[261,["They think, \"Why not? I am such and such, why shouldn't I know?\""]],[264,["But you cannot. As you have to have a microscope"]],[268,["to see things deeply,"]],[275,["in the same way you have to have"]],[277,["this new awareness within you, this dynamic awareness."]],[282,["Of course, the nature of Self is that it is collectively conscious,"]],[289,["that it is the source of peace and bliss,"]],[295,["that it is the truth and love."]],[299,["That's the nature. And you become that. You become."]],[303,["It's not only mental, but you really become."]],[306,["Because whatever is mental is artificial, man-made."]],[312,["Journalist: And do You perceive this … this collective unconscious"]],[316,["or this collective consciousness mentally?"]],[318,["Shri Mataji: Yes. The unconscious becomes conscious,"]],[322,["means it comes into your central nervous system."]],[327,["It is within you."]],[329,["Everyone has said it: Christ has said it, Mohammed has said it,"]],[333,["Buddha has said it, Mahavira has said it."]],[336,["Everyone has said the same thing."]],[338,["Like Lao-Tze, then, say, Zen system —"]],[343,["everything has said that you are to be born again,"]],[346,["there has to be some transformation within you."]],[349,["They didn't tell us lies."]],[351,["But the trouble is people can use this for their own purpose"]],[355,["and mislead others."]],[358,["That's a different point."]],[360,["But logically,"]],[362,["the disciples or the seekers also must know"]],[368,["that you must feel your own powers, you must feel your Self."]],[375,["Otherwise what's the use of just following somebody"]],[380,["where you achieve nothing of your own?"]],[382,["What did you achieve is the main point you should see."]],[385,["Journalist: And how do You grant this Self-realization en masse?"]],[389,["Shri Mataji: Yes. That's the only thing is new today,"]],[392,["is that it can be done on mass level."]],[395,["That's why in India it is called as Maha Yoga."]],[399,["Formerly it was done for one or two persons,"]],[402,["but now on very mass level you can do it."]],[405,["We had once — they were there —"]],[406,["six thousand people in a village called Khudus."]],[409,["All of them got realization."]],[411,["In India is very easy because they are not so complicated."]],[414,["But Indians take it for granted."]],[417,["They know what Sahaja Yoga is, they know what realization is."]],[421,["I mean, they are trained that way,"]],[423,["or I should say they are conditioned that way,"]],[425,["that they understand it faster."]],[428,["But when the Western people get it …"]],[432,["they are sometimes difficult,"]],[434,["but once they get it they are very deep"]],[437,["and they think this is the solution,"]],[439,["the only solution for all the calamities."]],[442,["So they work it out very seriously,"]],[446,["and really, they are doing very good work."]],[450,["Journalist: Is it harder to grant Self-realization to Westerners?"]],[455,["Shri Mataji: I used to think so, but the other day, in Adelaide,"]],[459,["I was amazed that they got it without any difficulty."]],[463,["So many of them, there must be about three hundred people in that hall,"]],[466,["it was all packed — and they all got it."]],[468,["So all My ideas about that also are now changing,"]],[472,["that suddenly I'm meeting the right type of people, I think."]],[477,["Journalist: But how is it that You actually"]],[479,["give them this mass level of consciousness?"]],[481,["Sahaja Yogi: How do You do it, Mother?","Shri Mataji: How do I do it."]],[485,["As I said, it's spontaneous."]],[490,["A seed, if you put it in the Mother Earth,"]],[493,["it sprouts by itself. You cannot say how you do it."]],[496,["But … because you are just ready for it."]],[499,["It's like one enlightened light can enlighten another light."]],[503,["Even if you put your hands towards Me like this, you can get it."]],[506,["It's so simple. And then you can give it to others."]],[509,["Once you get it, you can give it to others."]],[514,["Journalist: And with due respect,"]],[516,["we get a lot of Eastern visitors to Australia now,"]],[520,["with different prayer or different types of religion."]],[523,["But who do we know is leading us,"]],[527,["and who do we know is misleading us?"]],[529,["Shri Mataji: You see, you must use your brains. For everything."]],[534,["God has given you a very good brain and logic."]],[539,["And logically, you must reach proper conclusion about your realization."]],[543,["First of all, you must truly find out"]],[546,["whether you want your realization or not."]],[549,["Because if some people want to fly in the air,"]],[552,["then I can't give that."]],[554,["If some people want to have diamonds — that I can't do,"]],[558,["some sort of funny miracles that they do, all these tricks."]],[562,["So you have to be honest, first of all, about it."]],[566,["Secondly, you must know that this is Love of God"]],[571,["and you cannot sell it in the market."]],[573,["You cannot purchase ...(unclear)"]],[576,["That's one of a very important things one should know."]],[579,["Because they pamper your ego in a way"]],[583,["that you are purchasing your guru, that he is in your pocket."]],[586,["That's what one feels."]],[588,["But you cannot pocket the guru, guru has to be higher than you."]],[594,["Then you have to find out the lifestyle of such a guru."]],[599,["How is he? How he lives? Is he an honest man?"]],[604,["Is he a righteous person? Or is he…"]],[608,["You must find out the credibility of such a person."]],[611,["Apart from that, you must find out the credibility"]],[614,["of the followers also, what are they doing."]],[617,["There are so many gurus who have got followers for eighteen years,"]],[621,["sixteen years — and they are epileptic!"]],[624,["If the guru can't even look after their health,"]],[627,["then what's the use of having such a guru for yourself?"]],[630,["But human beings are very competitive"]],[633,["in certain things, it seems.","Journalist: Sorry, really?"]],[635,["Shri Mataji: They are very competitive, amusingly."]],[638,["Like, they see a person coming out of the pub, falling in the gutters,"]],[641,["and they enter into the same pub. Sort of thing, you see."]],[644,["It's sort of a competition that they get into."]],[647,["And they think, \"Why, this man has gone to this guru, so I'll go.\""]],[650,["It's a fashion!"]],[651,["People talk, \"Who is your guru?\" And the other says, \"This is my guru.\""]],[654,["It's … really, I can't understand how people can do that."]],[658,["Journalist: Yes, but, You see, it's sprung up like that."]],[660,["Shri Mataji: Yes. What I'm saying, this is a special time,"]],[664,["a time of your resurrection, the time of your judgment."]],[667,["So, there is a need. There is a need."]],[672,["But people are so vulnerable"]],[675,["and so naive, I would say, very naive,"]],[677,["not to understand who is right and who is wrong."]],[682,["It's very simple. People come out of the jail,"]],[686,["wear a funny dress and go to America,"]],[688,["sit in a square and start singing something funny."]],[694,["Everybody will: \"Oh, look at him, what a very great…\""]],[698,["Moreover, a kind of a inferiority complex, I think,"]],[701,["people have who are householders."]],[703,["They think they are very selfish, they are rearing their children"]],[707,["and looking after their household. It is not."]],[709,["It is one of the greatest jobs, is to be properly married"]],[713,["and to have nice children."]],[714,["But if you see somebody wearing that dress —"]],[717,["he \"has given up everything in the world\", you see —"]],[720,["you feel so enamored."]],[722,["It's superficially you cannot judge it."]],[728,["Journalist: Do You believe Yourself to be the (unclear)?"]],[731,["Shri Mataji: Beg your pardon?"]],[732,["Journalist: I asked that, er,"]],[734,["do You believe Yourself to be the only true Guru"]],[736,["or are there other organizations that offer enlightenment as well?"]],[741,["Sahaja Yogi: Do You believe that You are the only true guru"]],[744,["and are there other organizations who offer enlightenment?"]],[747,["Shri Mataji: There are many true gurus also in India,"]],[750,["it's not true that I'm the only true guru."]],[752,["But I'm the only Mother, I should say."]],[754,["Because these true gurus, who are living in Himalayas"]],[758,["and other places on the hills, don't want to come down."]],[763,["They don't want to mix with people."]],[766,["I sent one fellow with great coaxing and persuasion to America."]],[771,["He ran away within three days from there. He said,"]],[773,["\"They can't understand, they are just the other way round people."]],[776,["They can't understand God. They understand dollars.\""]],[782,["So there are many gurus. And they recognize Me quite all right."]],[785,["That's why when they say that \"She is the …"]],[788,["what did you say … greatest saint\" or anything,"]],[790,["is all said by these gurus, only have told them."]],[793,["Journalist: What about in the West,"]],[794,["do You think that they are — gurus or not gurus —"]],[797,["but do You think that they are of religious organizations?"]],[799,["Shri Mataji: Yes, yes, some people have taken oaths, you see."]],[802,["It's a good enterprise to make big money, you see."]],[804,["Now imagine, one guru has made six thousand crores of rupees."]],[810,["Now, crore is hundred and then … hundred and then … thousand…"]],[814,["Sahaja Yogi: Sixty."]],[815,["Shri Mataji: Thousand and then…","Sahaja Yogi: Multi-billion."]],[817,["Shri Mataji: Hundred thousand and then hundred of that is one crore."]],[821,["So six thousand crores of rupees he has made in India alone,"]],[826,["God knows how much in the Swiss Bank."]],[828,["Another one has got fifty-nine Rolls-Royces."]],[831,["Another one who has run away from India has purchased three aeroplanes"]],[835,["and thirty-five Rolls-Royces."]],[839,["They have a special liking for Rolls-Royce, I think."]],[842,["Seems so. One must understand that it's a very big enterprise."]],[846,["Even Oberoi [owner of Oberoi Hotels] cannot afford it."]],[848,["Journalist: You could say it's got good knowledge of the marketplace."]],[850,["Sahaja Yogi: Yes."]],[851,["Shri Mataji: Yes, they know, you see, they're very clever."]],[853,["Not only, they have employed people to tell them about it."]],[856,["You see, they have employment of, also, publicity department."]],[859,["They have every sort of department. I mean, it's a big enterprise."]],[863,["Journalist: For being a guru.","Shri Mataji: Beg your pardon?"]],[865,["Journalist: Being a guru is a big enterprise."]],[867,["Sahaja Yogi: Being a guru is a big enterprise."]],[869,["Shri Mataji: Very big enterprise if you can venture it, really."]],[872,["I mean, some English people have tried it."]],[874,["They have been successful, but not so much as Indians."]],[876,["I think Indians are clever to do that job."]],[879,["Sahaja Yogi: I've missed the point you were asking."]],[881,["Journalist: Yes, I think…","Sahaja Yogi: But she asked"]],[882,["are there any enlightened gurus in the West."]],[885,["Shri Mataji: Did you?"]],[886,["Journalist: Yeah. Are there genuine spiritual leaders in the West?"]],[889,["Shri Mataji: Yes, yes, yes, I said so, there are many."]],[891,["Yes, there are many. All over the world they are, not only in India."]],[894,["Journalist: Do You consider some of the Western"]],[896,["religious organizations to be genuine?"]],[899,["Shri Mataji: They are all genuine because they believe so,"]],[901,["but they don't create genuine effects. That's the point is."]],[905,["You may believe something is genuine in ignorance, see?"]],[908,["For example, you may believe that a particular diamond"]],[912,["is a real diamond, because they're ignorant about jewellery."]],[914,["But when you want to sell it in the market,"]],[916,["you find out that it's not so."]],[918,["That's what is happening to our religions now."]],[921,["The thing is, all religions have to seek within themselves"]],[927,["and get their Self-realization. Which they are not doing."]],[931,["They're, too, having buildings."]],[933,["They, too, are having organizations."]],[936,["They're, too, having … what you call … big market places."]],[941,["All that is … all coming to economics again,"]],[943,["or to politics at the most,"]],[947,["but not to God."]],[952,["Journalist: How is it that the, er,"]],[954,["there are gurus in the world that won't come into the West?"]],[959,["Why do You come to the West?","Shri Mataji: Me?"]],[961,["Sahaja Yogi: The ones that … there are many that won't come to the West."]],[964,["Why have You come to the West?"]],[965,["Shri Mataji: You see, because I'm the only"]],[967,["venturesome person, I think."]],[970,["Journalist: Sorry, what did You say?"]],[972,["Shri Mataji: I said I'm the only venturesome person."]],[974,["But apart from that, I must tell you, it was so arranged"]],[978,["that My husband got elected to this job in England,"]],[982,["elected by 134 nations, four times unanimously."]],[987,["Journalist: What do You think …"]],[989,["how long have You lived in the West now?"]],[991,["Shri Mataji: No, I don't live here much, you see, I go to India also."]],[995,["I've been traveling quite a lot."]],[997,["I've been to India, I've been to all the places,"]],[999,["and I have to go about with My husband also. I've been to Russia,"]],[1001,["I've been to China, all over the places, Argentina, every place."]],[1006,["Journalist: Apart from the material circumstances of life,"]],[1008,["what do You think is different between the West and the East?"]],[1012,["Just forgetting the material circumstances,"]],[1015,["You know, what do You think"]],[1016,["is different about us?","Shri Mataji: Western people?"]],[1018,["Journalist: Yeah, and the Eastern people.","Shri Mataji: They are very…"]],[1020,["Sahaja Yogi: Other than material aspects.","Journalist: Yeah."]],[1022,["Shri Mataji: No, they are very honest people, very honest."]],[1025,["Journalist: Western?"]],[1027,["Shri Mataji: Very honest, they are very honest people."]],[1030,["Really, they are honest, no doubt of it."]],[1033,["And about themselves also they are very honest."]],[1039,["I have tremendous regard for them."]],[1040,["You see, the Indian real gurus, as you may call them,"]],[1045,["are even frightened of Indians, leave alone the Westerners, you see."]],[1050,["They think they'll be crucified or their throats will be cut."]],[1053,["They have been tortured also, I must say."]],[1057,["One fellow cannot walk"]],[1059,["because his legs were broken and hands were broken."]],[1062,["Because, you see, there is a big struggle"]],[1065,["between the reality and unreal things."]],[1068,["Because these people are having a business proposition."]],[1071,["You understand that."]],[1073,["It's a very big business organization."]],[1076,["So, if anybody says anything against it,"]],[1081,["then they can pay people to get after you,"]],[1084,["they can kill you, they can do anything they like."]],[1086,["It's a mafia."]],[1089,["It's not easy, to face these horrible people."]],[1094,["They are all multimillionaires."]],[1099,["Journalist: Have You suffered similar experiences"]],[1101,["and people try to kill You or…"]],[1103,["Shri Mataji: They try, but doesn't succeed."]],[1107,["Yesterday only we had a meeting and there were two boys"]],[1110,["from this TM, I think paid by TM, whatever it is."]],[1114,["They tried to be very funny."]],[1116,["And I'd say the whole public got after them; they ran away."]],[1121,["They said, \"Now you can't have it, dog-in-the-manger policy"]],[1124,["you have got. Now you can't have it, so let us have it at least.\""]],[1127,["So they went away."]],[1129,["They try. It's all right. I mean, I expect all that."]],[1134,["Journalist: Can You just tell us something if the … Your …"]],[1138,["Your yoga school is developed from…"]],[1143,["Sahaja Yogi: It's not a yoga school.","Journalist: No, it's…"]],[1146,["Sahaja Yogi: You get your realization, and you then become a person"]],[1150,["who becomes a realized person. And you just…"]],[1154,["Journalist: But it has started from … through the influence of…"]],[1158,["Sahaja Yogi: Yes. Not influence."]],[1160,["I got my realization when I went to India."]],[1162,["I've been looking. I've been to all these false gurus,"]],[1165,["all these places where I saw some shocking things happening,"]],[1168,["and I … absolutely shocked and disillusioned."]],[1171,["I was about to come home, but somebody had given me"]],[1174,["Mataji's telephone number. She was in India at that time from England."]],[1178,["And I went to Her and I thought,"]],[1180,["\"My goodness, this is all so very different.\""]],[1181,["I was starting to feel incredibly peaceful and joyful,"]],[1185,["and amazing things were happening inside me,"]],[1188,["which were very … very wonderful,"]],[1190,["and it all seemed so normal. And yet so…"]],[1193,["Shri Mataji: And healthwise. First of all he improved healthwise."]],[1195,["Journalist: What was your trade…"]],[1197,["Sahaja Yogi: I'm a doctor. I mean, I was very skeptical…"]],[1199,["Journalist: General practitioner?","Sahaja Yogi: No, I've trained as such,"]],[1202,["but I've been practicing in natural health"]],[1204,["because I'm a bit disillusioned with the medical side."]],[1207,["And many of my patients had been going to India"]],[1210,["on these spiritual pilgrimages — and coming back worse."]],[1213,["And I wondered why. Because I was reading all these books"]],[1215,["that were saying these great gurus"]],[1217,["and they were speaking about Christ, and Mohammed,"]],[1220,["and Krishna, and all these things."]],[1221,["And they were coming back in a worsened condition."]],[1224,["So I thought the two things were a disparity."]],[1226,["On the one hand, they seemed to be those spiritual masters."]],[1229,["On the other hand, these people were coming back."]],[1231,["But they had a very good rationalization,"]],[1233,["they'd say they were purifying themselves,"]],[1235,["or they were cleansing themselves,"]],[1237,["or they were going through some karmas, or something like that."]],[1240,["So I couldn't sort it all out."]],[1241,["So I went to India. I stayed there a few months."]],[1244,["And finally I met Mother."]],[1246,["And it seemed so logical, and so sensible, and so scientific."]],[1250,["I mean, it agrees with all the medical science."]],[1252,["It underpins medical science, in fact."]],[1254,["Shri Mataji: I've also studied medicine."]],[1256,["Sahaja Yogi: It was quite incredible. And now it just seems so easy."]],[1259,["Journalist: So you do some yoga practice"]],[1260,["as part of your daily routine day?"]],[1263,["Sahaja Yogi: Meditation in a very simplified form."]],[1265,["When you feel this cool vibration on your hand,"]],[1267,["and above your head, and over your body,"]],[1269,["you know that you are in meditation.","Shri Mataji: You are in meditation."]],[1271,["Sahaja Yogi: That's it. That's it."]],[1272,["Journalist: Do you do any sort of asanas or you just…"]],[1274,["Sahaja Yogi: Not many. Just a few if you got a specific problem."]],[1277,["Shri Mataji: You see, it depends on. It's very scientific."]],[1280,["It depends on where you have a problem."]],[1282,["Say, for example, you have a problem in your stomach."]],[1285,["Now, you have to do certain exercise for that,"]],[1288,["for a short time, till you get rid of it."]],[1291,["Or may be that you have to say certain mantras for that,"]],[1294,["to excite, or to awaken, that part within you"]],[1298,["into liveliness."]],[1300,["That's how … it is very scientific."]],[1302,["But gradually you'll know it, so easy it becomes,"]],[1304,["the whole thing becomes so easy."]],[1306,["Because when you are expanding towards the periphery,"]],[1311,["the whole thing becomes complex."]],[1313,["But when you integrate towards the center,"]],[1316,["then everything is very simple,"]],[1317,["you have to deal with simple principles."]],[1320,["And once you know how to manage that… for example, balance."]],[1323,["Balance in a person is very important."]],[1326,["Balance in a person is not dealt with"]],[1329,["in, say … in medical science."]],[1332,["While we have one medical science,"]],[1334,["then we have psychologists, we have this and that."]],[1336,["We have one doctor for one eye and another doctor for another eye."]],[1340,["Here, it's one person,"]],[1342,["who is the one who cures you,"]],[1347,["he diagnoses you,"]],[1348,["he gives you realization — is everything."]],[1351,["The laboratory, the complete instrument is human being."]],[1354,["And this is created by God within you beautifully, it's all there."]],[1358,["Just to be connected to the mains, that's all."]],[1362,["It's all ready there."]],[1363,["I mean, nothing fantastic for Me, because I know it is there."]],[1366,["But once you get it, you are amazed how you have started working it out."]],[1370,["Because we are not aware of ourselves."]],[1374,["Every one of you can get it. Every one of you."]],[1378,["Journalist: How did You develop the Self-realization,"]],[1380,["were You born with it or…"]],[1382,["Shri Mataji: I was born with it."]],[1383,["Journalist: So, from the day You were born You knew it?"]],[1386,["Shri Mataji: Yes. Yes."]],[1388,["Journalist: When did You know it that You have been born with it?"]],[1392,["When did You discover it?"]],[1393,["Shri Mataji: You see, it is like if I ask you a question"]],[1395,["when did you discover you are a human being."]],[1398,["You won't be able to say."]],[1399,["It's as simple as that, you see. I was quite aware of it."]],[1404,["Journalist: When You say Self-rea— I mean, I know I'm a human being."]],[1406,["I mean, what do You mean by Self-realization here?"]],[1408,["Shri Mataji: You can, everyone can get it."]],[1410,["As long as you are a human being, you get it, that's all."]],[1413,["Sahaja Yogi: It's a higher level of awareness than human awareness."]],[1416,["You're not using your thinking brain."]],[1418,["You're not using your emotional brain."]],[1420,["You're using what is basically the all-pervading Power of God,"]],[1424,["the unconscious, about which Jung…"]],[1426,["Shri Mataji: That is reflected within you."]],[1428,["Sahaja Yogi: Jung spoke about it.","Shri Mataji: You see,"]],[1429,["it is reflected within you as Kundalini, we call it."]],[1434,["In Sanskrit language it is called as Kundalini."]],[1437,["But this also word is so terrifying to people,"]],[1440,["those who have read about Kundalini; they get a fright."]],[1442,["She is your Mother, the one who has to give you the rebirth."]],[1446,["Now, there are people who have written so many such big books,"]],[1449,["without knowing where the Kundalini lies."]],[1451,["Imagine. Absolutely vain."]],[1454,["Now, you can see it in some people, pulsation of the Kundalini."]],[1457,["We have got also on videotapes some of these things"]],[1460,["when we saw on some people, where there was obstruction,"]],[1463,["the pulsation goes out."]],[1465,["The pulsation, you can see sometimes"]],[1467,["this triangular bone, sacrum, just pulsating."]],[1472,["But imagine, this thing was called as sacrum, means sacred."]],[1477,["And I asked the Greek people;"]],[1480,["I said, \"Why did you call it sacrum?\""]],[1482,["They said, \"We had a rapport with the Indo-Aryan group,"]],[1488,["much before Alexander went to India,"]],[1490,["and they told us that this bone is the sacred bone.\""]],[1497,["Sahaja Yogi: If you burn the bone,"]],[1499,["the bone is so ossified that it's the last one to burn."]],[1503,["Shri Mataji: Yes, you need a very high temperature to burn that bone."]],[1508,["Journalist: I'll ask: You worked with Gandhi, didn't You?"]],[1511,["What were Your impressions of Gandhi?"]],[1513,["Shri Mataji: What are My impressions?"]],[1515,["Journalist: Yeah."]],[1516,["Shri Mataji: Oh, he was a very great man,"]],[1518,["very much needed at that time."]],[1520,["And if he had survived, he would have supported Sahaja Yoga"]],[1523,["out and out, no doubt about it."]],[1524,["Journalist: Sorry?"]],[1526,["Shri Mataji: If he had survived,"]],[1527,["he would have supported Sahaja Yoga out and out."]],[1534,["Journalist: How much contact did you have with Gandhi?"]],[1536,["Shri Mataji: It's quite a lot. As a child I was very close to him,"]],[1540,["and he used to call Me Nepali."]],[1542,["Because according to My features were more Nepali,"]],[1544,["My complexion was Nepali, he used to call Me Nepali."]],[1548,["And very affectionate towards children. Very affectionate."]],[1552,["Otherwise he was a hard-task master himself,"]],[1554,["towards himself and towards others,"]],[1557,["but very kind gentleman as far as the children were concerned."]],[1562,["And you could even overrule him by sweetness."]],[1565,["I mean, supposing he says, \"I don't want to have any juice just now.\""]],[1568,["You can say, \"Bapu, have a little bit,"]],[1570,["otherwise we won't have,\" or something. He would just melt away."]],[1574,["So sweet inside."]],[1576,["Journalist: Have You seen the film version of him?"]],[1577,["Shri Mataji: Yes, I've seen it.","Journalist: What do You think of it?"]],[1580,["Shri Mataji: Film is very good, I must say. It's very good."]],[1582,["Journalist: Is it accurate?","Shri Mataji: Yes, very."]],[1585,["It is very accurate, but in some ways,"]],[1588,["you see, I would say that …"]],[1592,["for example, Gandhiji, you see, was an Indian."]],[1595,["And the Indian style of talking"]],[1597,["is rather different from what you people talk."]],[1600,["Because you are very intelligent people and you're sharp-witted,"]],[1604,["you see; you know words, I mean, you are very well read,"]],[1607,["so you say few things in a very sharp way,"]],[1610,["immediately you answer in a way that is …"]],[1614,["very, I should say, acute, absolutely."]],[1619,["But he was an Indian, so the Indian, you see,"]],[1622,["doesn't say such a … such … sudden …"]],[1626,["he just springs with such a sudden intelligent remarks, you see."]],[1632,["They are gentler people, I think."]],[1635,["They speak in a gentler way, in a little roundabout way."]],[1639,["Sahaja Yogi: He couldn't sit on the floor properly."]],[1640,["Shri Mataji: That also you could find out"]],[1642,["that he couldn't sit properly on the floor."]],[1644,["That's why— but that's not so important."]],[1646,["What I felt was the only thing…","Journalist: He did in the film."]],[1648,["I'm not a critic, he did in the film."]],[1650,["Shri Mataji: That's one thing about him,"]],[1652,["and the essence of it is, you see,"]],[1654,["that whatever was — which was such a short time"]],[1659,["to bring forth such a deep thing —"]],[1662,["I think he has done full justice."]],[1664,["Except for one point that Gandhiji never wanted to provoke."]],[1668,["He never used these sinister methods of provoking others."]],[1672,["He was a very genuine person, you see."]],[1676,["And I think that is little bit lacking."]],[1680,["He didn't do it to … just to, you see …"]],[1682,["with a mind that would provoke others."]],[1686,["No, he wouldn't think of such a thing."]],[1689,["It was just he thought that if he … has no other way out."]],[1693,["Because you don't know what times we had."]],[1695,["I mean, in this picture he couldn't show anything."]],[1697,["It was very oppressive time."]],[1699,["For three hundred years, can you believe?"]],[1702,["So to talk of anything was impossible."]],[1705,["My father himself went to jail many a times."]],[1708,["My mother went five times to jail."]],[1710,["Of course, later on he was Member of the Constituent Assembly,"]],[1713,["Parliament, everything."]],[1714,["My brother is also a Minister of Steel now"]],[1717,["in India, in the Cabinet."]],[1719,["But that time, it was so difficult, very difficult."]],[1726,["They used to torture people much more than is shown there."]],[1730,["Individually. They used to hound out."]],[1733,["Journalist: Do You know Mrs. Gandhi?"]],[1735,["Shri Mataji: Oh, yes, I like her."]],[1737,["Journalist: Do You ever met her personally?"]],[1739,["Shri Mataji: Yes, I've met her once or twice."]],[1741,["But I wonder if she remembers Me now."]],[1745,["You see, she is a very busy person."]],[1747,["I mean, she is a solution just now for us, we can say."]],[1751,["Journalist: What do You think are the immediate problems"]],[1753,["facing India at the moment?"]],[1755,["Shri Mataji: If they take to Sahaja Yoga, they can be all solved"]],[1758,["because it also gives you material freedom."]],[1762,["It also gives you material blessings."]],[1765,["You see, we have too much black magic and all that in our country."]],[1768,["It's very heavy (…)."]],[1770,["And once you get into those things, you get the poverty."]],[1777,["Journalist: Just on that point, Mother,"]],[1779,["a couple of years ago in an interview You were more talking"]],[1781,["about Self-realization and less inclined to talk about"]],[1785,["so-called group miracle cures and so on."]],[1788,["I noticed in the press release"]],[1790,["there's quite a heavy accent on cures."]],[1793,["Have You done that specifically,"]],[1795,["to perhaps reinforce Your message or get Your message across?"]],[1799,["Shri Mataji: Which one?"]],[1800,["Sahaja Yogi: He is saying that there seems to be an emphasis"]],[1802,["in the press release on curing."]],[1806,["Shri Mataji: No, no, I did not. Did you feel that way?"]],[1808,["Oh God, I'm not doing that. Really."]],[1810,["Sahaja Yogi: \"Has Your emphasis changed?\" is his question."]],[1812,["Journalist: What I'm saying is that I gather that two years ago"]],[1815,["that You weren't emphasizing it…"]],[1816,["Shri Mataji: No, no, no. No, never, never, never."]],[1818,["Journalist: … but the press release that supports Your trip here"]],[1820,["indicates the more … other side of it,"]],[1826,["which, of course, has opened a little more skepticism."]],[1829,["Shri Mataji: Curing, it is a by-product. Curing is a by-product"]],[1831,["of Self-realization."]],[1832,["You see, Self-realization is most important."]],[1835,["You see, God is not interested in curing every Dick, Tom and Harry."]],[1839,["Say, for example, Hitler wants to get cured. Should we cure him?"]],[1842,["It's better cure for him to go to hell,"]],[1845,["at least for one lifetime,"]],[1847,["and then come back, to see what people have suffered."]],[1854,["So, it's never … accent is never on curing at all,"]],[1857,["and I, out of compassion —"]],[1861,["you see, because it works — I work out."]],[1863,["But this isn't important. I don't know why you felt that way."]],[1866,["I don't know what they have given you. I have no idea"]],[1868,["as to what they have given you and what is accentuated,"]],[1871,["but as far as I am concerned,"]],[1873,["for Me Self-realization is the main thing. That's My job."]],[1878,["Sahaja Yogi: In fact, Mother takes emphasis away from curing"]],[1881,["at the public programs."]],[1882,["Shri Mataji: I tell them not to cure anyone."]],[1884,["I said, if they want to cure, let them work on My photograph."]],[1888,["Let the photograph take all the load."]],[1889,["You don't take any load of curing."]],[1892,["Journalist: Perhaps then You better talk over"]],[1893,["the situation with your public relations people."]],[1896,["Sahaja Yogi: We don't have any."]],[1897,["Shri Mataji: Any. We don't have any publicity, nothing."]],[1899,["They do it on their own, spontaneously."]],[1902,["They will realize if they have made mistake,"]],[1904,["then put it right next time."]],[1906,["I don't know what's happening and all that. I don't know anything."]],[1910,["They are doing on their own. Let them learn."]],[1912,["They gradually learn, you see."]],[1913,["Better ways of healing and all that."]],[1916,["Let them learn. They'll all learn."]],[1919,["Journalist: Can we just clarify that:"]],[1921,["do You claim that You can heal or cure?"]],[1925,["Shri Mataji: I do not claim, I do it."]],[1928,["No question of claiming, you see."]],[1930,["I do it. I've done it. You can do it also."]],[1935,["Everyone can do it. This Doctor Warren has done."]],[1938,["He's cured so many people."]],[1940,["Journalist: You've just said it could be done through photograph."]],[1943,["Could You explain that?"]],[1944,["Shri Mataji: Yes, it is surprising, you know."]],[1946,["Myself I was surprised, as you are,"]],[1948,["that My photograph has also got vibrations"]],[1951,["and people get cured with photographs."]],[1953,["In your country only when I came, the press was very kind to Me."]],[1958,["The reason was there was a lady who was sick with coma."]],[1962,["And they said she had got blood…"]],[1964,["Sahaja Yogi: Cerebral aneurism."]],[1966,["Shri Mataji: Aneurism."]],[1967,["And one another disciple of Mine"]],[1971,["took My photograph, put it under her head."]],[1974,["And she started getting all right,"]],[1977,["in the sense that she started opening her eyes."]],[1980,["So the doctors got frightened. They said,"]],[1982,["\"Even if she gets all right, she will be damaged."]],[1985,["She won't be able to walk.\""]],[1986,["But today she's perfectly all right. Not only that,"]],[1989,["but she is very hard-working Sahaja Yogini. So it's all right."]],[1994,["Journalist: How does it work? When you (…) the photograph."]],[1996,["Sahaja Yogi: How does it work? How does it work from the photograph?"]],[2000,["Shri Mataji: From the photograph?"]],[2002,["The photograph is a real image of Myself, you see."]],[2006,["And this My body has got a coefficience"]],[2009,["which emits vibrations."]],[2011,["Same happens with the photograph."]],[2015,["That, too, has the same coefficience."]],[2017,["Of course, it hasn't got the other dimension,"]],[2020,["but it also emits the vibrations"]],[2022,["because of the coefficience being the same."]],[2027,["Say, even if you take Christ's photograph — it's not real,"]],[2030,["because it's all come out of the unconscious, all right,"]],[2033,["but there's a lot of imagination put into."]],[2035,["Any photograph if you take of any person, it is like that."]],[2038,["But there are so many things I've seen which are …"]],[2042,["which have come out of the Mother Earth. They emit vibrations."]],[2045,["Like, Stonehenge in England has vibrations."]],[2050,["So many places like that have vibrations,"]],[2052,["but not so strong as Mine, because I am a living person."]],[2059,["Journalist: What is Your idea of God? What is God?"]],[2063,["Shri Mataji: My idea?"]],[2064,["It's not only idea, but it's the truth that I feel about God."]],[2068,["God …"]],[2073,["is …"]],[2077,["difficult to put Him in words, isn't it?"]],[2082,["Is the witness"]],[2085,["of the play of His Power."]],[2090,["He is separated from His Power,"]],[2094,["and He's just witnessing the play of His Power."]],[2098,["And the Power is creating,"]],[2103,["is protecting, nourishing the creation,"]],[2107,["and evolving it."]],[2109,["Till this play is up to the animal stage,"]],[2115,["everything is under the control."]],[2118,["But to give it a greater freedom,"]],[2126,["they have to give first freedom to human beings at this level."]],[2130,["So this freedom was granted."]],[2132,["So that you learn what is your mistake,"]],[2135,["what is your right thing; you decide."]],[2138,["You develop yourself with that."]],[2141,["You create a balance within yourself."]],[2144,["And then you ascent to the spirit,"]],[2148,["by which you know God's power flowing through you."]],[2152,["This is all the game is. In short I'm telling you."]],[2156,["So this God is the witness of this play."]],[2161,["He is the Father, we can say, and His power is the Holy Ghost."]],[2166,["And He sends His Son on this Earth to redeem people."]],[2171,["He plays a very important part, Christ, in our lives."]],[2175,["And all other Incarnations."]],[2177,["All of them have a meaning — and a place within ourself."]],[2180,["Christ also has a special place within us,"]],[2183,["which is the gate of the limbic area."]],[2190,["Journalist: So You are a Christian, as well as being an Indian?"]],[2194,["Shri Mataji: Oh, I'm not a Christian,"]],[2196,["in the sense that I don't belong to any Church."]],[2199,["Neither I'm a real Hindu, Christian, everything."]],[2203,["Because they are all based on the same principle of God."]],[2208,["See, these are all flowers"]],[2212,["who were …"]],[2218,["on the same tree of life."]],[2225,["But people plucked it, saying,"]],[2227,["\"This is mine. I am that. I am that.\""]],[2231,["And then the flowers became ugly —"]],[2236,["and dead."]],[2239,["That's why people think Christianity has failed you,"]],[2242,["Hinduism has failed you, Islam has failed you."]],[2245,["It's not the Prophets. It's not the Incarnations."]],[2248,["It's we — by possessing them."]],[2250,["We cannot possess God."]],[2252,["We cannot possess religion, we are in religion."]],[2255,["Means religion is our valency."]],[2260,["Just like carbon has valency of four, we have valency of ten."]],[2264,["That is in this part of our being, where the attention is."]],[2269,["And if we are balanced people, if we live with moderation,"]],[2273,["the ascending was fast."]],[2275,["But even the extremists of extremists have got realization."]],[2279,["So the grace is flowing"]],[2281,["very generously, I should say, to achieve that."]],[2285,["Even alcoholics, you see, who come to Me — in alcoholic state —"]],[2289,["become overnight wonderful people."]],[2292,["Journalist: Overnight?"]],[2293,["Shri Mataji: Overnight, you'll be surp— overnight."]],[2296,["There are druggists and chemists and smokers."]],[2298,["Journalist: (…)."]],[2301,["Journalist: Can You cure me of smoking?"]],[2302,["Shri Mataji: Beg your pardon?"]],[2303,["Journalist: Can You cure me from nicotine?"]],[2305,["Shri Mataji: Yes, yes."]],[2311,["Journalist: Do You consider Yourself to be a saint or a prophet?"]],[2315,["Shri Mataji: What is the relevance of this question?"]],[2318,["Journalist: Well…"]],[2319,["Shri Mataji: I just don't understand."]],[2321,["Everyone of them are asking, \"Do you consider?\""]],[2324,["If I was not considering Myself, why would I work like this?"]],[2327,["Do I think I'm a thief?"]],[2329,["Or what I think of Myself? You see, it's a funny question, isn't it?"]],[2332,["You just tell Me. I don't understand the relevance."]],[2334,["Because everyone of them are asking these questions to Me:"]],[2337,["\"Do you think?\" It's a— what is it?"]],[2340,["I must be thinking something about it, I must be aware of Myself,"]],[2343,["otherwise I won't take up this work."]],[2345,["See now: I have a husband who loves Me very much,"]],[2348,["I have a very comfortable house of My own,"]],[2351,["I have My own children and grandchildren."]],[2354,["I don't get anything out of this for Me,"]],[2357,["except that I have a satisfaction that I'm sharing My joy"]],[2361,["with all of you. All right?"]],[2362,["Now, unless and until I'm aware of Myself,"]],[2365,["do you think I will do such a thing?"]],[2366,["Anyone of you will do this thing without getting anything out of it?"]],[2372,["Can anyone in this world can do such a thing? Tell Me."]],[2377,["Without any purpose?"]],[2379,["Journalist: Well, I think somebody's just called You"]],[2381,["the greatest living saint and…"]],[2383,["Shri Mataji: Yes. I mean, they can call Me anything, you see."]],[2385,["But what I'm saying — that, you see …"]],[2388,["asking this question … supposing I said, \"Yes, I think so.\""]],[2391,["Then you'll say, \"She is very ego-oriented.\" All right."]],[2394,["If I say, \"I don't think so,\" then suggest, \"She's diffident.\""]],[2397,["You see, it's a very funny thing, you know."]],[2399,["So it's like a … this is a question that is irrelevant."]],[2402,["Unless and until I am aware of it, why will I do this work?"]],[2408,["Journalist: I suppose, in the West we think of saints"]],[2410,["with halos around their head, you see."]],[2412,["Shri Mataji: Yes, you can see that also if you become realized souls."]],[2415,["You do. You will see that. Many see that."]],[2418,["I will show you one photograph. Have you got that? Let us see it."]],[2422,["YOGINI: This is a nice one.","Sahaja Yogi: Ah, there. That one."]],[2425,["Shri Mataji: Just see this photograph. Can you explain?"]],[2427,["Journalist: Sorry?"]],[2428,["Shri Mataji: This photograph. I'm sitting in a village, outside."]],[2431,["And this … seven times this light fell on Me."]],[2435,["Have you seen Christ pray in that garden?"]],[2438,["Journalist: Oh yes, yes."]],[2439,["Shri Mataji: And this is the photograph. See now."]],[2442,["There are many other things people have seen in My photographs."]],[2445,["There's one photograph where they have seen"]],[2447,["lights coming out of My fingers, My toes."]],[2450,["They have got these photographs. So for you…"]],[2455,["Journalist: Couldn't that just be a reflection from a glass"]],[2457,["or something like that?","Shri Mataji: No, no."]],[2458,["This has happened seven times and when I put down My head."]],[2462,["None of them could see at that time. It's not through a reflection."]],[2466,["Ask the photographer if she can explain."]],[2469,["Sahaja Yogi: We had the expertation."]],[2470,["Shri Mataji: All artificial gurus would try this trick, you see."]],[2475,["Journalist: I understand You began"]],[2477,["teaching Self-realization of people in 1970? Is that right or…"]],[2482,["Shri Mataji: No, not Self-realization. I had \"human-realization\"."]],[2485,["Journalist: Right."]],[2487,["Shri Mataji: I understood human beings at that time."]],[2490,["They are very complicated, I must say."]],[2493,["So many permutations and combinations."]],[2496,["And I had to study them thoroughly."]],[2501,["Because My father himself was a realized soul and he told Me"]],[2505,["that \"No use talking about God, saying anything about Him —"]],[2508,["it will become another Bible, another Gita."]],[2511,["You have to find out a mass realization method."]],[2518,["It has to work on masses.\""]],[2520,["And also you have seen any discovery"]],[2522,["which is not used for masses is wasted."]],[2527,["And he said, \"Otherwise, same thing will happen."]],[2530,["You will be crucified or they'll kill you. You'll be finished.\""]],[2532,["Then I knew I had come for this work, to achieve that."]],[2537,["So I had to study, work it out,"]],[2542,["the method by which en-masse evolution could be achieved."]],[2547,["And when I did it, I would say it was My human-realization,"]],[2551,["in the sense that I found an opportune time to start."]],[2563,["Journalist: Will You continue to do this travel around the world"]],[2565,["until You die or…","Shri Mataji: What is it?"]],[2568,["Sahaja Yogi: Will You continue to travel around the world"]],[2570,["doing this work until You die?"]],[2573,["Shri Mataji: It's very futuristic."]],[2575,["I don't think of My death so far."]],[2579,["As long as I can do, I'll do it, but …"]],[2582,["I mean, if some … these people are realized,"]],[2584,["then, I think, they'll give Me some rest sometime, isn't it?"]],[2587,["I must also have some rest. Now I am sixty years of age."]],[2592,["How long do you want Me to live? It's for you to decide."]],[2596,["If you take over, then I need not live."]],[2599,["Journalist: You spend more … most of the time in London now, do You?"]],[2602,["Shri Mataji: Yes. Because My husband is there, My family…"]],[2605,["And he is a very busy man himself, you see, he is a…"]],[2609,["Journalist: Where did You come from originally in India?"]],[2611,["Shri Mataji: Beg your pardon?"]],[2612,["Journalist: Where did You live originally in India?"]],[2614,["Shri Mataji: Originally, near Ahmednagar."]],[2617,["It's the where the … our dynasty…"]],[2619,["Journalist: I mean, of big cities where … is that near a big city?"]],[2622,["Shri Mataji: It's a … it's a … district place,"]],[2626,["it's not a very big city, Ahmednagar. It's very near…"]],[2628,["Journalist: What is the biggest city it's near? Or…"]],[2631,["Shri Mataji: I lived in … with My husband in Delhi"]],[2634,["because he was with the former prime minister Lal Bahadur Shastri."]],[2638,["He was his secretary.","Journalist: Ahh."]],[2640,["Shri Mataji: Yes. And then I lived … he went to Tashkent also with him."]],[2643,["He was throughout with him. And then I lived in Bombay"]],[2646,["because he was Chairman of Shipping Corporation of India."]],[2649,["For years together I lived in cities."]],[2652,["I studied in Lucknow, in Lahore, in Medical College."]],[2655,["That's how I lived in cities."]],[2657,["But originally, My family,"]],[2659,["all of them come from this place, Ahmednagar."]],[2662,["I was born in a small little hill station,"]],[2665,["which is on the tropic of Cancer."]],[2673,["Journalist: Mother, what about reincarnation?"]],[2676,["Is that part of Your philosophy?"]],[2679,["Sahaja Yogi: Is reincarnation part of Your philosophy?"]],[2682,["Reincarnation."]],[2684,["Shri Mataji: Of whom?"]],[2685,["Journalist: Of everybody."]],[2687,["When we physically pass away, do we return (…)?"]],[2691,["Shri Mataji: Yes. Are you mean … you mean human beings?"]],[2694,["Journalist: Yes."]],[2695,["Shri Mataji: Of course, of course, of course. Of course."]],[2697,["Journalist: Perhaps then You could look at another situation,"]],[2701,["one of the mysteries of life. There are many people"]],[2703,["who appear to be honest, sincere and work hard,"]],[2705,["who suffer enormous tragedy and so on."]],[2708,["And there are people — I could name a couple but I won't —"]],[2712,["who seem to flow through,"]],[2714,["but they're not necessarily liked by their mate,"]],[2717,["You know, by their fellow human beings."]],[2719,["Is there a reason for that, perhaps attached spirits"]],[2722,["or something like that?"]],[2723,["Shri Mataji: Going to false gurus is very dangerous,"]],[2726,["is extremely dangerous. It's not so superficially to be treated."]],[2729,["You see, money I don't mind."]],[2731,["Because if they are thugs, all right, there are so many thugs."]],[2734,["We have mafia, we have all kind of things."]],[2736,["It doesn't matter, let them be thugs."]],[2739,["But it's not so simple as we think. It's very deep."]],[2742,["You see, they can bring forth all the diseases"]],[2746,["which are incurable within us."]],[2749,["Say, myelitis … what you call … osteomyelitis,"]],[2752,["cancer,"]],[2755,["heart attacks — all kinds of diseases"]],[2758,["which are absolutely incurable, beyond our control."]],[2762,["Then depressions, and then stresses within us…"]],[2765,["also they can bring …"]],[2768,["quite a lot of them give epilepsy to people, abnormal behavior."]],[2772,["Even in the plane if I am sitting, you see,"]],[2775,["I find some people are just doing like this, like that."]],[2778,["And most of them have been to this TM."]],[2781,["They have paid thousands and thousands of pounds"]],[2784,["to achieve that kind of a funny thing, burning this center,"]],[2789,["by which their necks come out like that"]],[2791,["and they are all the time twitching themselves or jumping."]],[2795,["Sahaja Yogi: He asked about spiritual possession too, Mother."]],[2798,["He asked about spiritual possessions."]],[2800,["Shri Mataji: Of course, this is spiritual possession."]],[2803,["Yes it is spiritual possessions. They become…"]],[2806,["Journalist: And did You have a method of driving away that spirit?"]],[2810,["Shri Mataji: Yes, yes, I do. I do try. You see, even…"]],[2812,["Journalist: So that's the key to solving many of these diseases."]],[2815,["Shri Mataji: Yes, yes, of course, of course. Because, you see,"]],[2817,["the cabbages are better sometimes than these people."]],[2821,["Poor things! You know, they are so suppressed"]],[2823,["that even if you show them a garlic,"]],[2826,["they are frightened and they tremble like this."]],[2827,["Garlic, can you imagine? They are afraid of garlics"]],[2830,["and afraid of onions. I mean, what are their myths?"]],[2833,["Some are just sex-points, without any sex activity."]],[2838,["Horrible things they are!"]],[2840,["They are neither human beings nor animals."]],[2844,["Terribly possessed, no doubt."]],[2849,["They can be cured, absolutely."]],[2851,["We have cured so many like that. You can meet so many …"]],[2854,["you won't believe them that they have been like that."]],[2858,["There's one gentleman here, standing, you can see him…"]],[2861,["Sahaja Yogi: He was a flyer in TM."]],[2865,["Journalist: What's a flyer?","Sahaja Yogi: Who can levitate."]],[2868,["Shri Mataji: You see, all they levitate, so-called."]],[2870,["Sitting on the floor you have to jump, you see."]],[2873,["And then you think that you are flying. And then you get possessed."]],[2876,["And they just start … sitting down they just come out of their seats,"]],[2880,["you see, as if somebody had ejected them out."]],[2885,["This is supposed to be flying."]],[2887,["Journalist: Do You (…)?"]],[2888,["Shri Mataji: Beg your pardon?"]],[2890,["Journalist: You ruined his theory, didn't You?"]],[2892,["Shri Mataji: Oh, horrible things they do."]],[2895,["In one of our ashrams, one fellow came"]],[2901,["because he went to a barbershop and he was having a …"]],[2906,["so he had to spend some time waiting outside."]],[2908,["So he saw one magazine there, where it was written about Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2912,["in a magazine called Yoga Today."]],[2915,["They are not supposed to read anything else, you see."]],[2918,["They are banned. Everything is secret. It's all mafia style."]],[2921,["So poor man, you see, hesitatingly took that thing,"]],[2924,["and he took that Yoga Today to read."]],[2927,["And there was My picture which said that \"If you feel cool breeze"]],[2931,["on this picture, then know that you are a realized soul.\""]],[2934,["So he tried to put the hands,"]],[2935,["and in the barbershop hall he went into contortions."]],[2938,["So he got such a fright that he telephoned to our ashram,"]],[2942,["and the gentleman who was on the phone"]],[2946,["was also … not a TM but another type;"]],[2949,["and he asked him, \"Are you feeling hot?\""]],[2952,["He said, \"I'm boiling this side.\""]],[2954,["He said, \"Have you done TM?\" He said, \"Yes. But how do you know?\""]],[2957,["He said, \"We know.\" Then he came down."]],[2959,["But when he came down there … and these people just took My name,"]],[2963,["and the fellow went into such a contortion"]],[2965,["and started barking like a dog"]],[2967,["that all the Sahaja Yogis got a fright,"]],[2970,["and they sent Me a SOS that \"Mother, please come to our help!\""]],[2973,["And I was going to have big … lots of people for dinner."]],[2976,["I said, \"What's it happening?\""]],[2978,["He said, \"There's a fellow who came here, he's behaving like this,"]],[2980,["and we are all frightened of him.\""]],[2983,["Then I told them what is to be done to pacify him."]],[2985,["But this fellow today is a very big Sahaja Yogi in London."]],[2989,["He was a manager of a very big estate company."]],[2994,["He lost his job, lost his money."]],[2997,["He became penniless doing this TM."]],[3005,["But now I am told this Rajneesh is coming to your Australia"]],[3009,["to bless you all."]],[3012,["This fellow Rajneesh, who is ousted from America…"]],[3016,["Sahaja Yogi: The orange people, they're called."]],[3017,["Shri Mataji: The orange people. He is trying to come here,"]],[3021,["so be careful."]],[3022,["Sahaja Yogi: The government's already typing up its regulations now."]],[3024,["Shri Mataji: He's bought only thirty-six Rolls-Royces"]],[3026,["and three aeroplanes."]],[3027,["I don't know what his ambitions are out of Australians."]],[3030,["Sahaja Yogi: He's been thrown out of India. Now that he got a dep—"]],[3033,["Shri Mataji: Not thrown out, he ran away."]],[3035,["Sahaja Yogi: He'd run away, sorry. He had a deportation order in America now."]],[3040,["We hear this coming through."]],[3043,["Journalist: What's his name?"]],[3044,["Sahaja Yogi: Rajneesh."]],[3046,["Shri Mataji: These orange people, you see."]],[3048,["Journalist: What is bad about Rajneesh?"]],[3051,["Shri Mataji: Horrible."]],[3053,["Journalist: But why?"]],[3055,["Shri Mataji: You see, what he does: he makes you into a sex-point."]],[3060,["He has mass sex. Mass sex, you see. Horrible things."]],[3064,["Journalist: Some people think that's all right."]],[3065,["Shri Mataji: Yes, those who like it go there and become mad, that's all."]],[3069,["That's all. You pay for it."]],[3072,["We have a film. I think we have a film. We can show you."]],[3075,["See, somebody has taken secretly the film of his work."]],[3078,["Sahaja Yogi: One of them, who is disenchanted."]],[3080,["Shri Mataji: One of them. He took a secret film of what they do inside."]],[3084,["And that was released in London, called as \"God Who Ran Away\"."]],[3089,["And in that they showed this mass thing and all that."]],[3092,["So what he does: he makes people absolutely impotent."]],[3095,["They become impotent by his method."]],[3097,["Possesses them at the sex point. And talks about sex all the time."]],[3101,["So they are so restless that they become mad."]],[3105,["And they give him money as much as he wants, you see."]],[3108,["He has told so many women that he was their husband"]],[3111,["in his previous lives. So they gave all their ornaments to him."]],[3114,["One Indian lady gave all her jewellery to him,"]],[3119,["very expensive jewellery."]],[3120,["So his brother and his … her … she was a widow."]],[3126,["Her brother and brother-in-law came to Me with her,"]],[3130,["that \"Please, Mother, cure her.\" I asked her, \"Why did you give?\""]],[3133,["She said, \"He was my husband in his previous life.\""]],[3136,["I said, \"Who told you?\" She said, \"He told me.\""]],[3139,["I said, \"But why do you believe?\" She said, \"I also feel the same way.\""]],[3142,["I said, \"But what about the husband whom you married,"]],[3145,["from whom you have children, who has given you all this jewellery?"]],[3148,["And why should you give it to this man, whom you never married?\""]],[3151,["\"No, I believe what he said.\""]],[3152,["She was absolutely in complete possession of him."]],[3157,["And no one knows where she is now. No one knows."]],[3161,["Journalist: There is … sorry … there are some other cults in Australia,"]],[3165,["and (…) would probably including the Moonies"]],[3167,["and the Hare Krishnas. What are Your opinions on them?"]],[3170,["Shri Mataji: Now, Moonies, of course, you know all very well."]],[3173,["I need not tell about them."]],[3175,["Journalist: You don't approve the Moonies?"]],[3176,["Shri Mataji: Of course not."]],[3178,["You see, when you become a Sahaja Yogi, you start loving your parents,"]],[3182,["loving your children, loving everyone. You solve your problems."]],[3188,["You don't hate anyone. You don't run away from anyone."]],[3192,["On the contrary, if these things happen, this is anti-God activity,"]],[3196,["absolutely anti-God activity,"]],[3199,["that you get out of your families completely,"]],[3201,["you have nothing to do with anyone."]],[3204,["This is absolutely anti-God."]],[3205,["The another sect is our great, what you call them, Hare Ramas."]],[3212,["And the first basic mistake they make"]],[3215,["is to say that vegetarianism is just way to God."]],[3219,["Taking Krishna's name, specially."]],[3221,["Because Shri Krishna, in Gita,"]],[3224,["the first chapter — is very outset —"]],[3228,["He told Arjuna that \"You have to kill.\""]],[3232,["Human beings, leave alone animals."]],[3236,["Then he said, \"How can I kill! Because there are my gurus"]],[3240,["and there are my relations!\""]],[3241,["So He said, \"You have to kill them."]],[3244,["To achieve a higher goal, you have to give up your lower goals.\""]],[3249,["This is what exactly He told."]],[3251,["Then later on it was introduced, in the Gita,"]],[3256,["that vegetarianism leads you to God. I don't know how."]],[3260,["Because they said"]],[3261,["that the people who are left-sided, emotional people,"]],[3265,["eat more meat, which is scientifically not true."]],[3271,["Those who are morbid people, those who are left-sided —"]],[3275,["means who have got … what you can say … conditioned people —"]],[3280,["they seldom eat meat."]],[3281,["The people who eat meat are the rajasic people,"]],[3284,["are the people who are more aggressive, more active."]],[3288,["So the inactive people eat less meat"]],[3290,["because protein acts as an activity."]],[3294,["So it's scientifically also."]],[3296,["But they don't understand science or anything, you see."]],[3298,["These people are told that \"You must not eat meat.\""]],[3304,["Finished. That's the end of a way."]],[3306,["Now, in India, out of poverty, so many people are not eating meat."]],[3311,["By not eating meat if you go to God, then everybody else was wrong —"]],[3314,["because Krishna Himself used to eat and Rama Himself ate."]],[3319,["Even Buddha ate it, because He died … because He died …"]],[3322,["Journalist: Buddha ate meat?","Shri Mataji: Beg your pardon?"]],[3324,["Journalist: Ate … ate meat?","Shri Mataji: Yes, He ate."]],[3326,["And He died because He ate a raw — by mistake — a raw meat"]],[3332,["of a … pig."]],[3335,["Or a wild boar, just wild boar. Of a wild boar."]],[3338,["So, He was eating. And in India"]],[3341,["only the so-called Brahmins don't eat, so-called Brahmins."]],[3344,["Because they thought this is the best way of befooling people."]],[3348,["But not that I am for eating meat or eating vegetables."]],[3352,["It depends on your temperament, what sort of a temperament you have."]],[3355,["Supposing you are very aggressive — it's better to eat vegetables."]],[3360,["Journalist: Carrots.","Shri Mataji: Yes. Grass."]],[3364,["But if you are non-aggressive"]],[3367,["and you get conditioned very easily, suppressed type,"]],[3370,["then you better eat meat."]],[3372,["Sahaja Yogi: I'm afraid we're going to have to finish it there."]],[3375,["Those that want to, you can see Mother privately and …"]],[3378,["for an interview if you want to."]],[3380,["That can be arranged later. So, can we wind it up? Are there any…"]],[3384,["Shri Mataji: On one point I'll say about them"]],[3386,["that what these people are doing in India is something so shocking."]],[3391,["I went to many places, in the district places,"]],[3397,["and the people like you, the newspaper people, came and said,"]],[3400,["\"Mother, why are You carrying these people in the villages here?"]],[3403,["We have had enough of them.\" I said, \"Why? What happened?\""]],[3406,["They said, \"We have so many beggars now let loose."]],[3409,["These people are now walking in the villages, you see, and begging."]],[3413,["And they are torturing everyone there."]],[3415,["Because our villages don't have so much money to look after them."]],[3418,["In the beginning, of course, they tried.\""]],[3420,["And they all bombard Me with questions"]],[3422,["that \"Why do you carry these people? They'll also come here as beggars.\""]],[3425,["I said, \"No, they are all employed people."]],[3428,["They are not beggars, don't be worried.\" They can't believe it."]],[3431,["They said, \"Now, first they came as aggressors"]],[3433,["and now they are coming as beggars and troubling us."]],[3436,["And a person is begging at your house.\""]],[3438,["Journalist: Is that the hippies?","Shri Mataji: Yes."]],[3441,["The hippies and these, also these Hare Ramas."]],[3444,["This is their special job."]],[3446,["And you said that … you see, they say they are saints."]],[3449,["So they said, \"We can't even eat our food properly,"]],[3452,["because they are standing at your doorstep asking for alms, you see."]],[3455,["Whatever we have we give them: 'Baba, save us from your problems!'\""]],[3458,["Journalist: It's like they play reverse"]],[3459,["(…), isn't it?","Shri Mataji: Yes. Imagine!"]],[3461,["And they think they are leading a very sane life, you know."]],[3464,["For only eating vegetarian food,"]],[3466,["they think they are very sane people."]],[3468,["God's people are never beggars."]],[3471,["They must have self-esteem and self-respect."]],[3474,["If they feel insulted, then they should give up this profession."]],[3479,["Sahaja Yogi: OK, those that want to see Mother further, see Ian,"]],[3482,["he's at the back there."]],[3483,["And we'll take it step further then. Thank you very much."]],[3488,["Journalist: Thanks very much for Your time."]],[3490,["Shri Mataji: Thank you very much all of you. Thank you very much."]],[3492,["I hope you convey the message"]],[3493,["so that many people get their realization"]],[3495,["and you don't have any more diseases,"]],[3498,["anything left in this country."]],[3499,["Sahaja Yogi: Let them know that Mother is speaking tonight"]],[3501,["and tomorrow night and Thursday night at the exhibition hall,"]],[3505,["exhibition buildings in Melbourne."]],[3510,["And She gives the experience at the program."]],[3512,["Shri Mataji: It acts. The main thing is it acts."]],[3516,["Sahaja Yogi: She actually gives the experience"]],[3518,["of Self-realization at the program."]],[3519,["Shri Mataji: Yes, I will, I will, there."]],[3523,["It has to act. That's the difference between others and Me, at least."]],[3527,["That much one can see clearly. It immediately changes you."]],[3531,["Yesterday we had one cancer patient of liver."]],[3533,["We should follow it, that case up."]],[3535,["Now, doctors have told him, \"Within one month"]],[3537,["you are going to die,\" you see. And I told him, \"All right.\""]],[3541,["I made him sit with his left hand towards Me and right hand outside."]],[3544,["He started feeling much better. And healthier."]],[3548,["And if he is cured, that's a proof."]],[3551,["Sahaja Yogi: And it's happened many times, under medical supervision."]],[3554,["Shri Mataji: I've also cured our president, Mr. Sanjiva Reddy."]],[3558,["If you want, you can write to him and find out."]],[3560,["He is cured of his cancer."]],[3561,["Journalist: Where is that person that had cancer"]],[3564,["that you saw in Australia?"]],[3565,["Shri Mataji: Here in Adelaide. He came only yesterday,"]],[3569,["and he felt very much better after that."]],[3571,["So many people felt better."]],[3573,["Some people had stomach trouble, and some people had frozen arms…"]],[3577,["Everybody felt better."]],[3579,["Their arms opened out, automatically."]],[3583,["Journalist: When You claim cures like that,"]],[3584,["do You get flak from the medical profession and…"]],[3588,["Sahaja Yogi: When You claim cures like that,"]],[3589,["do the medical profession oppose You?"]],[3592,["Shri Mataji: No, I have many doctors who are My disciples now."]],[3594,["Many doctors. You see, there are so many things still left"]],[3597,["to the doctors to do. I'm not interested in patients."]],[3600,["But if they come to My program, they get all right."]],[3602,["I'm not (…), I don't go to hospitals."]],[3604,["Sahaja Yogi: It challenges too much, challenges too much"]],[3606,["within our fabric of knowledge."]],[3608,["Shri Mataji: No, but they won't be angry with Me, I'm sure,"]],[3610,["because they are overloaded with patients."]],[3613,["They won't be so angry, I can assure you."]],[3615,["They won't be so angry.","Journalist: That's very true."]],[3616,["Shri Mataji: You see, I'm not interested in curing,"]],[3618,["but they take … if they get cured, what should I do?"]],[3623,["Automatically they get cured."]],[3626,["Sahaja Yogi: Certainly the people that develop their realization"]],[3629,["get better. That's not … there's no question about."]]]);
